        {
          "text": " Walinzi wake ni vipofu, wote pia hawana maarifa; wote ni mbwa walio bubu, hawawezi kulia; huota ndoto, hulala, hupenda usingizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
